Significance: minor
Type: added

Button blocks get their own settings in the editor's Styles tab: text and background colors with a contrast warning, a Fill or Outline style, and a text size. The published page uses them too. Width and Border Settings now size the button itself rather than the card around it, so a corner radius rounds the button and a width sizes it. A new checkbox turns on the "Powered by PayPal" line under the button; it starts off, and only the button format offers it — the QR code draws the code and its caption. The Light / Auto / Dark preset is gone, since it only changed the editor.
